---
layout: base.njk
title: Journal
description: Luke’s journal about making games and videos.
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<div class="reading">
  <header class="page-head">
    <p class="kicker">Read</p>
    <h1>Journal</h1>
    <p class="lede">How the games and the videos get made, written as it happens. There’s a <a href="/journal/feed.xml">feed</a> if you want the new ones delivered.</p>
  </header>
  <ul class="entries">
    {%- for post in collections.journal | reverse %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}{% if post.data.type == "weekly" %} <span class="kind">Weekly</span>{% endif %}</a>
      <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | niceDate }}</time>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>
